cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MagLogic: Nanomagnetic Logic Simulation Suite"
abstract: >
  MagLogic is a computational framework for analyzing nanomagnetic logic
  devices and preparing workflows for external micromagnetic solvers. It
  provides magnetization analysis and demonstrations of reconfigurable logic
  gates based on triangular nanomagnetic elements; OOMMF and MuMax3 must be
  installed and run separately.
